[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/30.tres]荆州（汉末三国州治考）[/font][/b]


[color=#000000]基本信息：[/color]

[indent]•  性质：汉末十三刺史部之一；汉末三国争夺最激烈的战略要地[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  州治：多次迁移（汉寿→[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "襄阳", "cat": "geography"}]襄阳[/url][/color]→公安→[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "江陵", "cat": "geography"}]江陵[/url][/color]）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  地域范围：今湖北、湖南两省大部，并延伸至豫南、赣北、粤北、桂东北、黔东一带[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
